OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'mistaken' over cycle
OL,4,Alane rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing a rumoured cycle lane
OL,8,Fplan, with yellow ribbons tied around
OL,9,Ftrees said to be at risk.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council has denied plans
OL,12,Ffor a bike lane involving tree removal
OL,13,Fon Stamfordham Road in Westerhope, but
OL,14,Fsome local councillors claim they have
OL,15,Fbeen told about a scheme which would
OL,16,Fsee 30 trees felled.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1787161720
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i G2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'mistaken' over cycle
OL,4,Alane rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Liberal Democrat-led authority
OL,7,Fsaid it would not go ahead with a new
OL,8,Ftransport project without "genuine"
OL,9,Fcommunity involvement, and those
OL,10,Ffearing the loss of trees were
OL,11,F"mistaken".
OL,13,FIt has also sparked concern about
OL,14,Fworsening congestion in a busy part of
OL,15,Fthe city where thousands of homes have
OL,16,Fbeen built over recent years.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
